 "name_zh": "奥朗日古罗马剧场和凯旋门",
 "name_zh_source": "unesco_official",
 "name_en": "Roman Theatre and its Surroundings and the \"Triumphal Arch\" of Orange",
 "name_local": "Théâtre antique et ses abords et « Arc de Triomphe » d'Orange",
